
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101a16">
  <meta name="description" content="In The Azalea Garden — a reusable all-over print tote bag featuring bright red azaleas at the NC Arboretum in Asheville.">
  <title>In The Azalea Garden | Where Nature Speaks</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --background: #101a16;
      --panel: #19251f;
      --cream: #f3f0e7;
      --muted: #b8c1b8;
      --sage: #a8b99e;
      --line: rgba(243, 240, 231, 0.13);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--cream);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .site-header {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 25px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 23px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.2px;
    }

    .header-link {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: color 0.25s ease;
    }

    .header-link:hover,
    .breadcrumb a:hover {
      color: var(--sage);
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 1250px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 42px 7% 100px;
    }

    .breadcrumb {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .breadcrumb span {
      margin: 0 10px;
      color: #718075;
    }

    .product {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      gap: 75px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .product-image-wrap {
      background: var(--panel);
      border-radius: 5px;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .product-image {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      object-fit: cover;
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      transition: transform 0.7s ease;
    }

    .product-image-wrap:hover .product-image {
      transform: scale(1.025);
    }

    .product-info {
      padding-top: 12px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--sage);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 58px);
      line-height: 1.12;
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: var(--sage);
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 23px;
      margin-bottom: 27px;
    }

    .description {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.9;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .details {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 22px 0;
      margin: 27px 0 30px;
    }

    .details-title {
      color: var(--cream);
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .details p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .etsy-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      background: var(--sage);
      color: #142019;
      padding: 16px 29px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 1.7px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .etsy-button:hover {
      background: var(--cream);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }

    .etsy-note {
      color: #8f9c91;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .site-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 35px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .footer-brand {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .footer-tagline {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .credit {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .credit:hover {
      color: var(--sage);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1050px) {
      .product {
        gap: 45px;
      }

      .page {
        padding-left: 5%;
        padding-right: 5%;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .product {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 35px;
        max-width: 650px;
        margin: auto;
      }

      .product-info {
        padding-top: 0;
      }

      .page {
        padding-top: 30px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 46px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .site-header {
        padding: 19px 5%;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 19px;
      }

      .header-link {
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }

      .page {
        padding: 25px 5% 65px;
      }

      .breadcrumb {
        margin-bottom: 23px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 39px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        font-size: 20px;
      }

      .description {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .etsy-button {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 16px 20px;
      }

      .site-footer {
        padding: 28px 5%;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      .brand {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .header-link {
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 34px;
      }

      .page {
        padding-left: 4%;
        padding-right: 4%;
      }
    }

    @media (orientation: landscape) and (max-height: 500px) {
      .page {
        padding-top: 20px;
        padding-bottom: 45px;
      }

      .product {
        gap: 30px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="https://wherenaturespeaks.com">
      Where Nature Speaks
    </a>

    <a class="header-link" href="https://wherenaturespeaks.com">
      Home
    </a>
  </header>

  <main class="page">

    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="https://wherenaturespeaks.com">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <a href="https://wherenaturespeaks.com">Collection</a>
      <span>/</span>
      In The Azalea Garden
    </div>

    <section class="product">

      <div class="product-image-wrap">
        <img
          class="product-image"
          src="il_794xN.8717797542_qlmv.webp"
          alt="Bright red azaleas in bloom at the North Carolina Arboretum in Asheville"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="product-info">

        <p class="eyebrow">Where Nature Speaks Collection</p>

        <h1>In The Azalea Garden</h1>

        <p class="subtitle">All-Over Print Reusable Lined Tote Bag</p>

        <p class="description">
          Bright red azaleas caught mid-bloom on a rainy morning at the NC
          Arboretum in Asheville; their petals still beaded with rain against
          a backdrop of deep green leaves.
        </p>

        <div class="details">
          <p class="details-title">Product Details</p>
          <p>• Reusable all-over print tote bag</p>
          <p>• 100% polyester</p>
          <p>• Also available as a placemat set</p>
        </div>

        <a
          class="etsy-button"
          href="https://www.etsy.com/listing/4556994107"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Buy with Etsy <span>↗</span>
        </a>

        <p class="etsy-note">
          Secure checkout and ordering through Etsy.
        </p>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">

    <div>
      <p class="footer-brand">Where Nature Speaks</p>
      <p class="footer-tagline">Capturing the beauty of the natural world.</p>
    </div>

    <a
      class="credit"
      href="https://vonvisualdesigns.com"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Made by Von Visual Designs ↗
    </a>

  </footer>

</body>
</html>
